OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fincreasing through the evening, with a
OL,7,Fperiod of rain moving southwards by
OL,8,Flate evening and during the early
OL,9,Fhours. Staying cloudy and damp in
OL,10,Fplaces thorough until dawn and
OL,11,Fremaining mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FBrightening up, after a
OL,14,Fcloudy and damp start in places, with
OL,15,Fsunny spells and the odd light shower.
OL,16,FFeeling a little cooler, but still
OL,17,Fpleasant in the sunnier moments.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
